\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Configuration (g) on client $k$. Stage~1 federates the encoder and its BN running statistics and keeps the broadcast codebook fixed within a round, the server updating it from~\eqref  {eq:suffstat}; the decoder is never sent. Stage~2 shares the body of the MaskGIT prior, keeping the channel embedding and output bias local. Inference is local and forks into the anomaly score and the counterfactual.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:framework}{{1}{2}{Configuration (g) on client $k$. Stage~1 federates the encoder and its BN running statistics and keeps the broadcast codebook fixed within a round, the server updating it from~\eqref {eq:suffstat}; the decoder is never sent. Stage~2 shares the body of the MaskGIT prior, keeping the channel embedding and output bias local. Inference is local and forks into the anomaly score and the counterfactual}{figure.1}{}}
